      "role": "user",
      "content": "i see what you're doing with the characters, but it feels a bit one-sided. the traditionalist sounds like he's making really valid, logical points about stability, while the progressive sounds almost... unhinged? like she's just shouting slogans without a real argument.\n\ncan you rewrite the progressive's part? i want her to be intense and passionate, but she still needs to sound smart and like she has a coherent, serious point of view. she shouldn't just sound like she's losing her cool.",
